#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:122
msgid ""
"_: Variable bitrate\n"
"VBR"
msgstr "Veranderlike bis tempo"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:125
msgid ""
"If set to CBR the MP3 encoding is done with a constant bitrate. If set to VBR "
"then a variable bitrate is used. Typically a variable bitrate gets better "
"quality but is often out of sync. You should try it first with some test "
"encodings."
msgstr ""
"As jy CBR kies sal MP3 enkodring met 'n konstante bis tempo geskied. As jy VBR "
"kis sal 'n veranderlike bistempo toegepas word. 'n Veranderlike bistempo gee "
"gewoonlik 'n beter klank kwaliteit, maar kan baie keer video/oudio "
"sinkronisasie probleme veroorsaak. Probeer dit eers in 'n toetslopie voordat jy "
"dit vir ernstige projekte aanwend."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:208
msgid "%1 kbits"
msgstr "%1 kgps"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavset.cpp:287
msgid ""
"Select the video codec to encode to the final movie. XviD (www.xvid.org) is an "
"Open Source codec and has similar features to DivX5. DivX4 is the predecessor "
"to DivX5. All three codecs support 1-pass and 2-pass encoding. XviD (CVS) is "
"support for the latest nightly snapshots of XviD. Regarding quality, try all "
"the different codecs to find out which you prefer. Secondly, read the various "
"forums about MPEG-4 Encoding (www.doom9.org, www.xvid.org, www.divx.net, ... ). "
"The difference between a DivX4 and XviD 2-pass encoded movie is quite small. "
"Sometimes DivX4 (smoother) is better and other times XviD (sharper). If the "
"encoding process crashes then you probably haven't used the codec you have "
"installed. Due to the codec libraries having the same name, you can only use "
"DivX4 or DivX5 and XviD or XviD (CVS). This will be fixed in a future version, "
"so the codecs will auto-detect and can be used with different install "
"locations."
msgstr ""
"Kies die video kodeerder wat vir die finale film gebruik moet word. XviD "
"(www.xvid.org) in 'n Oop Bron kodeerder en het soortgelyke funksionaliteit as "
"DivX5.DivX4 is die voorganger van DivX5. Al drie hierdie kodeerders ondersteen "
"eenmalige en dubbel enkodering. XviD (CVS) verskaf daaglikse vrystellings van "
"die kode. Toets al drie die kodeerders om te besluit watter een se kwaliteit "
"vir jou die beste is.Lees gerus die forums aangaande MPEG-4 enkodering by "
"www.doom9.org, www.xvid.org of www.divx.net. Die verskil tussen DivX4 en XviD "
"dubbel enkodering is baie klein. Partykeer sal jy vind dat DivX4 (glad) beter  "
"is en ander kere weer DivX4 (skerp). DivX4, DivX5 en XviD se enkodeerder "
"biblioteke het dieselfde name. Dit kan veroorsaak dat die kodering proses omval "
"as jy 'n kodeerder naam spesifiseer wat nie op die stelsel geïnstalleer is nie. "
"Toekomstige weergawes sal die kodeerder outomaties eien."

