"only works with RGB. You must disable using YUV colorspace."
msgstr ""
"Die \"deinterlace\" filter: SmartDeinterlace werk nie in YUV modus nie. Jy moet "
"YUV kleur ruimte deaktiveer voordat jy dit kan gebruik."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:52
msgid "Extended Audio/Video Settings"
msgstr "Addisionele Oudio/Video Instellings"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:58
msgid "Keyframes:"
msgstr "Sleutel rame:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:59
msgid ""
"Keyframes (same as I-frames) are \"full\" pictures of an MPEG-stream. They are "
"similar to a simple JPEG and have the best quality in a video. All pictures "
"following are only stored as differences to a keyframe. Here you can set the "
"maximum distance between two keyframes. In most cases this will rarely be used, "
"as the codec will automatically insert a keyframe on each scene change. Default "
"is 300."
msgstr ""
"Sleutelrame (I-rame) is vol prente in 'n MPEG-stroom. Hulle stem ooreen met 'n "
"JPEG prent en beskik oor die beste kwaliteit in die video. Al die "
"daaropvolgende rame word net as verskille van die oorspronklike sleutelraam "
"gestoor. Die maksimum afstand tussen twee sleutelrame kan hier gespesifiseer "
"word. Die waarde word min gebruik, aangesien die kodeerder outomaties 'n "
"sleutelraam insit wanneer 'n \"scene change\" voorkom. Standaard waarde: 300"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:66
msgid "Crispness:"
msgstr "Skerpheid:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:67
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can smooth the video during the encoding process. It is better to "
"leave crispness at 100% for encoding and smooth the video during playback "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Die video kan hier tydens die enkodering proses glad gemaak word. Dit is egter "
"beter om die skerpheid op 100% te los tydens die enkodering proses en dit dan "
"glad te maak tyden terugspeel."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:72
msgid "Audio language:"
msgstr "Oudio taal:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Select the language and the surround mode. Typically there are \"MPEG2 "
"Stereo\", \"AC3 2ch and 6ch\" and \"DTS 6ch\". You can probably choose AC3 6ch, "
"AC3 2ch and MPEG2 Stereo in descending order, depending on your language (It "
"doesn't matter if DTS works or not, you can still try it)."
msgstr ""
"Kies die taal en die multikanaal (\"surround\") modus. Tipiese waardes is "
"\"MPEG2 Stereo\", \"AC3 2 en 6 kanaal\" en \"DTS 6 kanaal\". Die gewenste "
"keuses is gewoonlik, in afgaande volgorde, AC3 6kanaal, AC3 2 kanaal en MPEG "
"Stereo, afhangende van jou taal."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:79
msgid "Deinterlace mode:"
msgstr "Deinterlace modus:"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:80
msgid ""
"Select a deinterlace mode if you have interlaced material."
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Fast</strong> is the standard deinterlace mode</li>"
"<li><strong>Encoder Based</strong> uses the internal deinterlace of the codec "
"(be aware that some codecs may have no deinterlacer)</li>"
"<li><strong>Zoom to Full Frame</strong> no matter how it works but it is rather "
"good and slow. Use this if <strong>Fast</strong> still produces interlace "
"stripes or color artifacts (red shadow, etc.)"
"<li>"
"<li><strong>Drop Field/Half Height</strong> uses only one field and scales "
"it.</li>"
"<li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> provides a smart, motion-based "
"deinterlacing capability. Ported from VirtualDub by Tilmann Bitterberg. "
"Operates in RGB space only. Tilmann did some testing of deinterlace filters "
"available in transcode. You can view and read the result on tibit.org/video/. "
"</li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is a deinterlace for YUV mode by Thomas "
"Oestreich.</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Kies die \"deinterlace\" modus as die materiaal ge-\"interlace\" is."
"<ul>"
"<li><strong>Vinnig</strong> is die standaard \"deinterlace\" modus.</li>"
"<li><strong>Kodeerder Gebaseer</strong> maak van die dekodeerder se eie "
"\"deinterlace\" meganisme gebruik. (Let daarop dat sommige kodeerders nie "
"\"deinterlace\" funksionaliteit het nie.)</li>"
"<li><strong>Skaleer na volle raam</strong> - Hierdie metode is stadig maar gee "
"goeie resultate. Hierdie modus word aanbeveel as <strong>vinnig</strong> "
"nogsteeds \"interlace\" strepe en kleur afwykings veroorsaak.</li>"
"<li><strong>Ignoreer Veld/Halwe Hoogte</strong> gebruik net die een veld en "
"skaleer dit na volle grootte.</li>"
"<li><strong>SmartDeinterlace</strong> bied 'n intelligente, beweging gebaseerde "
"\"deinterlace\" filter. Dit is vanaf VirtualDub, deur Tilmann Bitterberg, "
"oorgedra. Dit werk net in die RBG kleur skema. Die resultate van Tilmann se "
"toetse kan besigtig word by http://tibit.org/video/</li>"
"<li><strong>YUVDeinterlaceMMX</strong> is 'n \"deinterlace\" filter vir die YUV "
"kleur skema, deur Thomas Oestreich.</li></ul>"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:111
msgid "Resample to 44.1 kHz"
msgstr "Hermonster na 44.1kHz"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:112
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the audio track will be downsampled from 48 kHz to 44.1 "
"kHz. Useful because some soundcards have problems with a sampling rate of 48 "
"kHz."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie opsie gekies is sal die snit se monster tempo van 48 kHz na 44.1 kHz "
"verlaag word. Dit is nuttig vir sommige klank kaarte wat nie 44.1 kHz monster "
"tempo kan handteer nie."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:115
msgid "Use YUV colorspace."
msgstr "Gebruik YUV kleur skema."

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:116
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the internal codec works with the YUV colorspace instead of "
"using RGB. Useful because DVD also has YUV colorspace and it is twice fast as "
"RGB. You only need RGB colorspace if a filter needs it (filters not yet "
"supported)."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie gekies is, sal die interne kodeerder met die YUV kleur ruimte i.p.v. "
"RGB werk. Dit is nuttig, aangesien DVDs reeds in YUV kleur ruimte geënkodeer "
"is. Dit is dubbed so vinnig as RGB. RGB is net nodig as 'n filter daarmee sou "
"werk"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:121
msgid "0 - None"
msgstr "0 - Geen"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:122
msgid "1 - Fast"
msgstr "1 - Vinnig"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:123
msgid "2 - Encoder Based"
msgstr "2 - Kodeerder gebaseer"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxavextend.cpp:124
