msgstr "Presies (-Z)"

#: videoEncoding/k3bdivxcrop.cpp:85
msgid ""
"\"Fast\" resizing is much faster than \"Exact\" resizing, but is limited to a "
"resize step multiple of 8 pixels."
msgstr ""
"\"Vinnig\" hervergrootting is baie vinniger as \"Presies\" hervergrootting, "
"maar dit is beperk tot inkremente van 8 beeld elemente (pixels)."

