msgstr "Skryf program:"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:115
msgid "Determine supported writing speeds"
msgstr "Bepaal die skryf snelhede wat ondersteun word"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:116
msgid ""
"<p>Normally K3b presents static list of writing speeds that is only based on "
"the maximum writing speed of the device."
"<p>If this button is clicked K3b tries to determine the writing speeds "
"supported with the mounted media."
"<p>Be aware that this only works with MMC3 compliant writers."
msgstr ""
"<p>K3b vertoon 'n lys van maksimum skryf snelhede vir die toestel."
"<p>As hierdie knoppie gedruk word sal K3b probeer om die skryf spoed vir die "
"huidige media te bepaal."
"<p>Let daarop dat dit net werk vir MMC3 aanpasbare skrywers."

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:181
msgid "The DVD writer that will write the DVD"
msgstr "Die DVD skrywer wat die werk gaan doen"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:182
msgid "The speed at which to write the DVD"
msgstr "Die spoed waarteen die DVD geskryf gaan word"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:183
msgid "The external application to actually write the DVD"
msgstr "Die eksterne program wat die DVD skryfwerk gaan doen"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:186
msgid "The CD writer that will write the CD"
msgstr "Die CD skrywer wat die werk gaan doen"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:187
msgid "The speed at which to write the CD"
msgstr "Die spoed waarteen die CD geskryf gaan word"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:188
msgid "The external application to actually write the CD"
msgstr "Die eksterne program wat die CD skryfwerk gaan doen"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:198
msgid ""
"<p>Select the DVD writer that you want to use."
"<p>In most cases there will only be one writer available which does not leave "
"much choice."
msgstr ""
"<p>Kies die DVD skrywer wat jy wil gebruik."
"<p>In die meeste gevalle sal daar net een skrywer wees, wat nie 'n veel van 'n "
"keuse laat nie."

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:201
msgid ""
"<p>Select the speed with which you want the writer to burn."
"<p><b>Auto</b>"
"<br>This will choose the maximum writing speed possible with the used medium. "
"This is the recommended selection for most media.</p>"
"<p><b>Ignore</b>"
"<br>This will leave the speed selection to the writer device. Use this if K3b "
"is unable to set the writing speed."
"<p>1x refers to 1385 KB/s.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kies die skryf spoed."
"<p><b>Outomaties</b>"
"<br>Dit sal die vinnigste moontlike spoed vir die media kies. Dit is die "
"aanbeveelde spoed vir die meeste media.</p>"
"<p><b>Ignoreer</b>"
"<br>Dit sal die spoed hou op dit wat vir die skryf toestel gekies is. Kies "
"hierdie as K3b nie die skryf spoed kan stel nie."
"<p>1x stem ooreen met 1385 KG/s.</p>"

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:212
msgid ""
"<p>Select the CD writer that you want to use."
"<p>In most cases there will only be one writer available which does not leave "
"much choice."
msgstr ""
"<p>Kies die CD skrywer wat jy wil gebruik."
"<p>In die meeste gevalle is daar net een skrywer, wat nie veel van 'n keuse "
"laat nie."

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:215
msgid ""
"<p>Select the speed with which you want the writer to burn."
"<p><b>Auto</b>"
"<br>This will choose the maximum writing speed possible with the used medium. "
"Be aware that this might not be a good choice when writing an Audio-CD "
"on-the-fly since the decoding of the audio files may take too long to allow a "
"continuous data stream."
"<p>1x refers to 175 KB/s."
"<p><b>Caution:</b> Make sure your system is able to send the data fast enough "
"to prevent buffer underruns."
msgstr ""
"<p>Kies die skryf spoed."
"<p><b>Outomaties</b>"
"<br>Dit sal die vinnigste moontlike spoed vir die media kies.  Let daarop dat "
"dit nie altyd 'n goeie keuse vir Oudio-CDs is nie. As die snitte wat gebruik "
"word eers gedekodeer moet word kan dit te lank neem om 'n aaneenlopende data "
"stroom vir die skrywer te lewer."
"<p>1x stem ooreen met 175 KG/s."
"<p><b>Waarskuwing:</b>Maak seker dat jou stelsel data vinnig genoeg kan stuur "
"sodat die buffer nie sal leeg loop nie."

#: k3bwriterselectionwidget.cpp:225
msgid ""
"<p>K3b uses the command line tools cdrecord, growisofs, and cdrdao to actually "
"write a CD or DVD."
"<p>Normally K3b chooses the best suited application for every task "
"automatically but in some cases it may be possible that one of the applications "
"does not work as intended with a certain writer. In this case one may select "
"the application manually."
msgstr ""
"<p>K3b gebruik die nie-grafiese programme <i>cdrecord</i>, <i>growisofs</i> "
"en <i>cdrdao</i> om fisies die CDs of DVDs mee te skryf."
"<p>K3b kies outomaties die beste program vir die taak wat verrig moet word. Dit "
"kan wees dat vir party skrywers die standaard waardes nie van toepassing is "
"nie. In daardie geval sal 'n program self gespesifiseer moet word."

