#: projects/k3bmixedburndialog.cpp:149
msgid ""
"<p><b>Standard mixed mode CD 1</b>"
"<p>K3b will write the data track before all audio tracks."
"<p>This mode should only be used for CDs that are unlikely to be played on a "
"hifi audio CD player."
"<p><b>Caution:</b> It could lead to problems with some older hifi audio CD "
"players that try to play the data track."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Standaard gemengde modus CD 1</b>"
"<p>K3b sal die data snitte skryf voor al die oudio snitte."
"<p>Hierdie modus moet net gebruik word as die CD waarskynlik nie op 'n Hifi CD "
"speler gespeel gaan word nie."
"<p><b>Waarskuwing:</b>Dit kan probleme op ouer oudio CD spelers veroorsaak wat "
"sal probeer om die data snit te speel."

#: projects/k3bmixedburndialog.cpp:157
msgid "Last track will contain the data"
msgstr "Laaste snit sal die data bevat"

#: projects/k3bmixedburndialog.cpp:158
msgid ""
"<p><b>Standard mixed mode CD 2</b>"
"<p>K3b will write the data track after all audio tracks."
"<p>This mode should only be used for CDs that are unlikely to be played on a "
"hifi audio CD player."
"<p><b>Caution:</b> It could lead to problems with some older hifi audio CD "
"players that try to play the data track."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Standaard gemengde modus CD 1</b>"
"<p>K3b sal die data snitte skryf na al die oudio snitte."
"<p>Hierdie modus moet net gebruik word as die CD waarskynlik nie op 'n Hifi CD "
"speler gespeel gaan word nie."
"<p><b>Waarskuwing:</b>Dit kan probleme op ouer oudio CD spelers veroorsaak wat "
"sal probeer om die data snit te speel."

#: projects/k3bmixedburndialog.cpp:166
msgid "The data will be written in a second session"
msgstr "Die data sal in 'n tweede sessie geskryf word"

#: projects/k3bmixedburndialog.cpp:167
msgid ""
"<p><b>Blue book CD</b>"
"<p>K3b will create a multisession CD with 2 sessions. The first session will "
"contain all audio tracks and the second session will contain a mode 2 form 1 "
"data track."
"<p>This mode is based on the <em>Blue book</em> standard (also known as <em>"
"Extended Audio CD</em>, <em>CD-Extra</em>, or <em>CD Plus</em>"
") and has the advantage that a hifi audio CD player will only recognize the "
"first session and ignore the second session with the data track."
"<p>If the CD is intended to be used in a hifi audio CD player this is the "
"recommended mode."
"<p>Some older CD-ROMs may have problems reading a blue book CD since it is a "
"multisession CD."
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Blue book CD</b>"
"<p>K3b sal 'n multisessie CD skep met 2 sessies.Die eerste sessie sal al die "
"oudio snitte bevat en die tweede snit sal 'n modus 2 form data snit wees."
"<p>Hierdie modus is gebaseer op die <em>Blue book</em> "
"standard. Dit staan ook bekend as <em>Uitgebreide Oudio CD</em>, <em>"
"CD0Extra</em> of <em>CD Plus</em>.'n Hifi oudio CD speler sal net die eerste "
"sessie herken."

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:54
msgid "DVD Project"
msgstr "DVD Projek"

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:111
msgid ""
"<p>For DVD-R(W) in sequential incremental mode and DVD+R it behaves like "
"multisession CDs."
"<br> <b>Caution:</b> Most DVD-ROM drives are only able to read the first "
"session and most likely even on DVD writers only the first session will be "
"mounted.</p>"
"<p>For DVD+RW and DVD-RW in restricted overwrite mode K3b will utilize "
"growisofs to <em>grow</em> the ISO9660 filesystem in the first session.</p>"
"<p><b>Be aware that K3b needs to write multisession DVDs on-the-fly.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<p>DVD-R(W)s in sekwensiële inkrementele modus en DVD+Rs reageer soos "
"multisessie CDs."
"<br><b>Waarskuwing:</b>Die meeste DVD-ROM drywe sal net die eerste sessie lees "
"en selfs DVD skrywers sal partykeer net die eerste sessie koppel.</p>"
"<p>Vir DVD+RW en DVD-RW in beperkte oorskryf modus sal K3b van <i>growisofs</i> "
"gebruik maak om die ISO9660 lêersisteem in die eerste sessie te skep.</p>"
"<p><b>K3b moet multisessie DVDs direk skryf.</b>"

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:183
msgid ""
"It is not possible to write multisession DVDs in DAO mode.Multisession has been "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Dit is nie moontlik om multisessie DVDs in DAO modus te skryf nie. Multisessie "
"is nou gedeaktiveer."

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:185
msgid "DVD multisession"
msgstr "DVD multisessie"

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:208
msgid ""
"K3b does only support writing multisession DVDs on-the-fly. Multisession has "
"been disabled."
msgstr ""
"K3b ondersteun net die skryf van multisessie DVDs as 'n direkte skryf. "
"Multisessie is nou gedeaktiveer."

#: projects/k3bdvdburndialog.cpp:210
msgid "DVD Multisession"
msgstr "DVD Multisessie"

