#: projects/k3baudiotrackwidget.cpp:57
msgid ""
"Preemphasis is mainly used in audio processing.\n"
"Higher frequencies in audio signals usually have lower amplitudes.\n"
"This can lead to bad signal quality on noisy transmission because the high "
"frequencies might become too weak. To avoid this effect, high frequencies are "
"amplified before transmission (preemphasis); the receiver will then weaken them "
"accordingly for playback."
msgstr ""
"Voor versterking word meestal in oudio verwerking gebruik.\n"
"Hoër frekwensies het laer amplitudes.\n"
"Slegte sein kwaliteit kan verkry word tydens versending. Om dit te voorkom word "
"die hoër frekwensies vooraf versterk en dan versend. by die ontvanger word dit "
"eers weer verswak voorda dit terug gespeel word."

